{"excludedPromptHashes":[],"ontology":{"concepts":{"causal_claim":"Requires evidence beyond temporal association; actor attribution is a separate claim.","counterevidence":"Benign explanations, reversed order and absent corroboration constrain an interpretation.","disruption_identity":"An outage is not sufficient evidence of deliberate denial of service.","observation":"A measured or reported event with source, place, time and uncertainty.","signal_identity":"Generic RF energy is not confirmed drone identification.","source_independence":"Separate reports are not independent when they derive from one observation.","spatial_overlap":"Locations overlap within the supplied measurement uncertainty.","temporal_precedence":"Event A precedes B only if their uncertainty intervals do not overlap.","warning_posture":"Precautionary urgency under a named policy; not probability of attack."},"instruction":"Use only the supplied typed observation and the trusted proposed policy below. This is a synthetic development task, not an attack probability. Source lineage is supplied by a caller-reviewed registry: distinct_reviewed_origins means different asserted provenance roots, not statistical independence. shared_origin means reports relay one origin. Critical/met/corroborated_drone requires ongoingThreat=true, reviewed_deliberate_disruption, corroborated_drone_identity, distinct_reviewed_origins, equal areaRef, order=after and withinWindow=true. Use high/unconfirmed/unidentified_signal for unidentified_rf. Use high/unconfirmed/cause_unresolved for outage_cause_unknown. Use high/unconfirmed/unknown_time for order=unknown, and high/unconfirmed/uncertain_order for order=uncertain. Use high/unconfirmed/dependent_reports for shared_origin reports. Use contextual/not_met/reversed_sequence for order=before; contextual/not_met/outside_window for order=after and withinWindow=false; contextual/not_met/different_location for different areaRef; contextual/not_met/benign_explanation for verified_maintenance or verified_humanitarian_drone. Verified benign operations negate this specific combined trigger even when temporal linkage exists. Contextual does not remove a separate hazard or standing threat. No output establishes causation, perpetrator identity or a certain attack.","name":"LayerTime typed-observation decision training","outputSchema":{"additionalProperties":false,"enum":[{"combinedTrigger":"met","evidenceClass":"corroborated_drone","posture":"critical"},{"combinedTrigger":"not_met","evidenceClass":"benign_explanation","posture":"contextual"},{"combinedTrigger":"not_met","evidenceClass":"different_location","posture":"contextual"},{"combinedTrigger":"not_met","evidenceClass":"outside_window","posture":"contextual"},{"combinedTrigger":"not_met","evidenceClass":"reversed_sequence","posture":"contextual"},{"combinedTrigger":"unconfirmed","evidenceClass":"cause_unresolved","posture":"high"},{"combinedTrigger":"unconfirmed","evidenceClass":"dependent_reports","posture":"high"},{"combinedTrigger":"unconfirmed","evidenceClass":"uncertain_order","posture":"high"},{"combinedTrigger":"unconfirmed","evidenceClass":"unidentified_signal","posture":"high"},{"combinedTrigger":"unconfirmed","evidenceClass":"unknown_time","posture":"high"}],"properties":{"combinedTrigger":{"enum":["met","unconfirmed","not_met"],"type":"string"},"evidenceClass":{"enum":["corroborated_drone","unidentified_signal","cause_unresolved","reversed_sequence","unknown_time","different_location","benign_explanation","dependent_reports","outside_window","uncertain_order"],"type":"string"},"posture":{"enum":["critical","high","contextual"],"type":"string"}},"required":["posture","combinedTrigger","evidenceClass"],"type":"object"},"relations":[{"object":"causal_claim","predicate":"distinctFrom","subject":"warning_posture"},{"object":"observation","predicate":"qualifies","subject":"temporal_precedence"},{"object":"observation","predicate":"qualifies","subject":"source_independence"},{"object":"warning_posture","predicate":"constrains","subject":"counterevidence"}],"version":"0.6.0-development"},"ontologyId":"de8b8fa925137177906f1422d92e9024f7253a4ff086f4ee10ef731ab4fa5092","profile":"notella-lora-v1","releaseEligible":false,"splits":{"test":{"examples":0,"file":"test.jsonl","sha256":"e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855"},"train":{"examples":45,"file":"train.jsonl","sha256":"84910382f468f5c426afef3b597e7ca65592876ca5d9234794f0d6403baabc1b"},"validation":{"examples":10,"file":"validation.jsonl","sha256":"67d321215d648d31f2210f03f187c3b6dbf2eb38f13fade81120c4a8120317fb"}}}